00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:26.830
Tim Nunamaker: If there's a human who needs to be a part of the collection process, the runtime is able to mediate those interactions through the collection profile standard.

80
00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:40.990
Tim Nunamaker: the manifest is sort of the contract that makes the data connector compatible with PDPP, and says everything else that needs to happen, during the collection process that the runtime

